<title>USA: S.L. Green files for 8.1 mln shr IPO.</title>
<headline>S.L. Green files for 8.1 mln shr IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>S.L. Green Realty Corp has filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a 1.8 million share initial public offering.</p>
<p>The real estate investment trust said in a statement Tuesday that it expects the offering to be completed in the third quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers Inc and Prudential Securities Inc will manage the offering.</p>
